# Wooden Void Fluid Pump tooltip
vmd.pump.desc.1=Non-electric wooden pump that taps the Overworld underground fluids.
vmd.pump.desc.2=Produces 100mB every 200 ticks into its internal output tank; a full or incompatible tank stalls the machine, draw the fluid out with pipes from any non-main face.
vmd.pump.desc.3=A programming circuit (configuration 1..N) must be inserted to select the N-th Overworld fluid; without it the pump idles.
vmd.pump.desc.4=The internal tank never mixes fluids; switch the circuit only after it is drained.
vmd.pump.desc.5=The programmed circuit can be configured directly in the circuit slot in the GUI (or a real programmed circuit can be inserted there).
vmd.pump.desc.selection=Current selection: %s
vmd.pump.selection.invalid=Invalid circuit configuration
vmd.pump.selection.no_circuit=No programming circuit inserted (idle)

# Wooden Void Miner
gt.blockmachines.VoidMinerWooden.name=Wooden Void Miner
gt.blockmachines.voidminerwooden.name=Wooden Void Miner

# Wooden Void Miner tooltip
vmd.miner.desc.1=Non-electric wooden miner that pulls ore items from the Overworld ore generation tables without breaking blocks.
vmd.miner.desc.2=Produces 1 ore item every 100 ticks into one of its 6 output slots (same items stack up); the machine stalls when none of the 6 output slots can hold more output, take the outputs out manually or with a conveyor.
vmd.miner.desc.3=Programmed circuit (configuration 1..N) in the circuit slot selects the N-th Overworld ore vein (its main ores plus its matching poor/small ores); configuration N+1 selects the full poor (small) ore pool.
vmd.miner.desc.4=Configuration 0 or no circuit mixes all veins and poor ores into one weighted pool (weights = generation weights).
vmd.miner.desc.5=A circuit configuration beyond N+1 idles the machine; the programmed circuit can be configured directly in the circuit slot in the GUI (or a real programmed circuit can be inserted there).
vmd.miner.desc.selection=Current selection: %s
vmd.miner.selection.poor=Poor ore pool
vmd.miner.selection.mixed=All ores (weighted)

